  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Safe Migration in Malaysia Through the Transformation of Recruitment Practices and Standards in the Supply Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with the Responsible Business Alliance (RBA) Foundation, the project aims to promote safe labour migration in the Indonesia-Malaysia and Nepal-Malaysia corridors and support businesses respect, promote and remedy the human and labour rights of women and men migrant workers in international supply chains. These objectives are in line with the overall aim to eradicate forced labour, end modern slavery and human trafficking.</narrative>
  </description>
